<title>USA: Entergy Corp Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Entergy Corp Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.47	 loss     $0.38</p>
<p> Net profit	109,760     loss     87,070</p>
<p> Revs		2,045,750		1,598,990</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  235,133		  227,780</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '97 results include $3 million allowance for equity funds used during construction, and $117.4 million (Corrects from $17.4 mln) in misc. income.</p>
<p>'96 results include writeoff of $194.5 million from River Bend rate deferral, $2.6 million allowance, and $10.8 million in misc. income.</p>
